  "properties": {
    "title": "Manage GeoServer configuration with Terraform",
    "description": "This presentation presents how to manage GeoServer configuration with a custom made Terraform provider. It will focus on the different resources available in the provider and the updates made since the last FOSS4G. Different use cases will be explained to show how you can use Terraform capabilities.",
